                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Save them once in your <strong>Library</strong> and find them
                            again in seconds.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4">
                        <svg class="mb-2 h-6 w-6 text-gray-900" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"
