                        monthly/yearly switch".</li>
                    <li><strong>Category</strong>: where it sits in the gallery.</li>
                    <li><strong>Tags</strong>: short words separated by commas, like <code
                            class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 font-mono text-[13px]">hero, dark, saas</code>. Tags are how
                        you filter later, and how AI picks references.</li>
                    <li><strong>Visibility</strong>: <em>Public</em> shows it in the gallery and your library.
                        <em>Private</em> keeps it in your library only. See <a href="#visibility"
                            class="font-medium underline">Public or private</a>.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

