                                <td class="px-4 py-3">"Find my pricing components." Searches by keyword or tag.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-900">get_component</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-3">"Give me that one as React." Returns the code in HTML, React, Vue
                                    or Svelte.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-900">save_component</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-3">"Save this new component." Added to your library as private.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-900">list_tags</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-3">"What tags do I use?" Returns every tag and how many components
                                    have it.</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4 text-sm"><strong
                        class="text-gray-900">Treat the token like a password.</strong> Anyone who has it can read and
                    add to your library. If it leaks, generate a new one.</div>
            </section>

